<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico assigns all secondary auctions.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico assigned all five auctions whereby it had sought to drain 2.604 billion pesos from the secondary market on Friday, dealers said.</p>
<p>The auctions were assigned as follows:</p>
<p>    AMOUNT     TERM	AVERAGE RATE</p>
<p>    500 million    17 days   24.69 pct</p>
<p>    500 million    12 days   24.62 pct</p>
<p>    500 million    10 days   24.55 pct</p>
<p>    500 million     5 days   24.75 pct</p>
<p>    604 million     3 days   24.30 pct</p>
<p>*Amounts in pesos</p>
<p>(( --Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9507))</p>
